  title: Pantry Inventory
  content: "Pantry Check\n\nWheat Flour \u2014 Low\nDried Herbs \u2014 Enough until
    midsummer\nApples \u2014 Spoiled\nPotatoes \u2014 Strange black roots. Discarded.\nHoney
